---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy policy — Rent Free News desk" description="No accounts, no paywall tracking. What our newsletter and analytics store, what ad partners may set later, and how to reach us.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <div class="kicker text-brand-600">Trust</div>
    <h1 class="font-display font-black text-[36px] tracking-[-0.02em] mt-1">Privacy</h1>
    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert font-serif mt-4">
      <p>We run a static site with no accounts and no paywall tracking. The newsletter is handled by our email provider, which stores your address only to send issues and lets you leave in one click.</p>
      <p>Site measurement is privacy-friendly analytics - page counts, not profiles. Advertising partners, when enabled, may set their own cookies; their policies will be listed on our <a href="/advertise/">advertise page</a>.</p>
      <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:desk@rentfreenews.com">desk@rentfreenews.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
